  "description": "Refurbishment of the internal unit, external facade including replacement of the front and rear infills, and external yard.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to first use of the development hereby approved, details of boundary treatments and any means of enclosure to the external yard, including the northern portion of the site, shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The approved boundary treatment shall be installed prior to first use and retained thereafter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reason: To protect the amenity and security of neighbouring occupiers and to ensure the area is appropriately enclosed and managed, in accordance with Policy LP2 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
